  "name": "Kale and Quinoa Salad",
  "subtitle": "A bright grain-and-greens salad with pecans, currants, and feta",
  "description": "Tender quinoa and chopped kale are tossed with a lemon-mustard dressing, crunchy pecans, sweet currants, and crumbled feta.",
